{"id":10157,"name":"necrozma-ultra","speciesId":800,"dex":800,"form":"other","generation":7,"types":["psychic","dragon"],"stats":{"hp":97,"attack":167,"defense":97,"special-attack":167,"special-defense":97,"speed":129},"abilities":[{"name":"neuroforce","hidden":false}],"height":75,"weight":2300,"baseExp":339,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10157.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10157.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10157.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10157.ogg","genus":"Prism Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"Reminiscent of the Ultra Beasts, this life-form, apparently asleep underground, is thought to have come from another world in ancient times."},{"version":"moon","text":"Light is apparently the source of its energy. It has an extraordinarily vicious disposition and is constantly firing off laser beams."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It looks somehow pained as it rages around in search of light, which serves as its energy. It’s apparently from another world."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Light is the source of its energy. If it isn’t devouring light, impurities build up in it and on it, and Necrozma darkens and stops moving."},{"version":"sword","text":"It survives by absorbing light. After a long time spent slumbering underground, impurities accumulated within it, causing its body to darken."},{"version":"shield","text":"It needs light to survive, and it goes on a rampage seeking it out. Its laser beams will cut anything to pieces."}],"genderRate":-1,"captureRate":255,"eggGroups":["no-eggs"],"isLegendary":true,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"necrozma","speciesId":800,"evolvesTo":[]},"varieties":[{"id":800,"name":"necrozma","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.g